{"title":"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/75952e52a3dc061d24146c0df9062a54a5ce5a5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=\\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"21\" />. The product of the real parts of the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa8209c894199b0a0322781fa64ccde7f5d7641.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^2-z=5-5i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b22d47d9fc1edaaffe413589a6a5e29739586ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -25\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } -6\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } -5\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{1}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"444\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Applying the quadratic formula gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/81902b90757e3fc2770af160faaa894b2640042a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z=\\frac{1\\pm\\sqrt{21-20i}}{2}\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/f/c9f697c18afd4b0692c7350675f7f586b93daa5e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{21-20i}=a+bi\\]\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are real. Squaring both sides and equating real and imaginary parts gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/6/4969f226b22fadd7f745b5b4a972809570585760.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2-b^2=21\\]\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/a/56a7b0232c236980cc5dce041495e3cc1ef345fd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2ab=-20\\]\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" /> Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/a/47a7805e282eff765fdb4ac433b92d7fbe98b6fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-\\frac{10}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"66\" height=\"37\" />, letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5dd1c499ce84568c3a41285945e63568e3113333.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2=n$\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> and solving gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/9/4993402a569534975090d5e079ae4556560d428b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=25, -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, from which we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/53897e4b47f6049266b4bffcef91bc949385b5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/6/b363a32cd810f50e0f9af3b77fbf527304758be3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-2$\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Replacing the square root in the quadratic formula with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/3/823fcd37acc06e6c5e88f8b2341df28ddcc6a1d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5-2i$\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" /> and simplifying gives the two roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/d/a2d3590ae04151f25396416a3bc9e2912af00212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d57edec59a7685d76e37bd3839eb0f5830d88fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2+i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"54\" height=\"15\" />. The product of their real parts is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/e/0bef113dbd3085b99216f8cc531ed4093eaf986f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ {-6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"70\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Complete the square to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/4/38414d5138d7ac8d207f1cd12b1a7fd2f7b77f90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(z-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2 = \\frac{21-20i}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"173\" height=\"48\" />.  \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/5/cd57d41aa9607c3490f55f78fc4f120adc210b4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left|\\frac{21-20i}{4}\\right| = \\frac{29}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"129\" height=\"45\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/8/4d880fafa25507f9c6f53e4a39fd53528581f1c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{21-20i}{4} = \\frac{29}{4}\\left(\\frac{21}{29}-\\frac{20}{29}i\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"219\" height=\"45\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/c/5ac7b6efa41adb27ffddf4b5ebe0eb86ac54d917.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left|\\frac{21}{29}-\\frac{20}{29}i\\right| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"120\" height=\"45\" />.  Therefore, there exists <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c5786fffced9710649ba7fa0627061001fcad5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq \\theta \\leq 2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"17\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/3/b23490a8e15f2f55bd35a40ea98fa8c8236971f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos \\theta = \\frac{21}{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/c/31cb53fe05f3aae03db48406feeddd843b537ba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\theta = -\\frac{20}{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/e/b2e3d8b379aa15aa7db76a94633fedd4e672dba4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(z-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2 = \\frac{29}{4}(\\cos \\theta + i \\sin \\theta)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"243\" height=\"48\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859524551787134ca1bb68aa36b5874f454f3438.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = \\frac{1}{2} \\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{29}}{2}\\left(\\cos\\frac{\\theta}{2} + i \\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"248\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/7/6b786269de3976db4ed02efdd088f24ebcb17a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos \\theta &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/3/b639ffe4d4276f5ffc2aaa96d38b5eb318c28e5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\theta &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/d/0adbe3eafbb84133b447adf1d7b6e2f4f0d12b6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3\\pi}{2} \\leq \\theta \\leq 2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8fe32dc7e44760e0375ca61dc48b89e4b43c9957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3\\pi}{4} \\leq \\frac{\\theta}{2} \\leq \\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"39\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/0/d10fc09d52ad678025eb17c5173e8890864c01d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos \\frac{\\theta}{2} &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/9/eb90eaf87bafcb3d4af884312240bcd38a4d70b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"74\" height=\"39\" />. \n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/b/52b8e09e0aaf182b45c835bfab06b2918890abfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos \\frac{\\theta}{2} = -\\sqrt{\\frac{1+\\cos\\theta}{2}} = -\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{29}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"246\" height=\"49\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57bab945af502fa9650927ae41e12ec6574a4024.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} = \\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{2}} = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{29}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"216\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/9060a87eda880e2072d54e6749fd09c0cb03a82f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = \\frac{1}{2} \\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{29}}{2}\\left(-\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{29}} + \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{29}}i\\right) = \\frac{1}{2} \\pm \\left(-\\frac{5}{2} + i\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"396\" height=\"48\" />.  Therefore, the two solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/a/b6a2c3a7e8f1e450475b6e5cbb83c87fb7a1e605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 3 - i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3da04c379b29163324ca29524bb8507bdf41c61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = -2 + i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" />, and the product of their real parts is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/b/95b26d3f041805917514da80fc29360472eae7aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ -6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"78\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME\" title=\"1992 AHSME\">1992 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016231503\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 271/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7917/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.677      1 -total\n 60.30%  